      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sea of Stars Original Soundtrack includes the complete package (200 tracks) from Day &amp; Night cycles, acoustic pirate band covers, and over 10 tracks from guest composer Yasunori Mitsuda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the release of Throes of the Watchmaker, this package now includes 47 additional tracks from the free DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We recommend playing the game before sifting through the files in order to avoid spoilers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Composer</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eric W. Brown</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guest Composers</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yasunori Mitsuda</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vincent Jackson Jones II</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Musician</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reece Miller</p></li></ul>",
